a.title:
DR-TB presumptive category when presumptiveTbType is DR-TB.
Source codes are:
a = Previously treated;
b = Contact of a DR-TB patient;
c = Failure to convert at the end of the second month of treatment.

Reason a patient diagnosed with TB had not started treatment.

Source codes:
1 = Pre-treatment loss to follow-up;
2 = Died before treatment initiation;
3 = Transferred to another facility for treatment enrolment.

